PE 821: 123-Separeted / 123分隔

=== Problem Summary ===
Numbers whose decimal representation contains the
digits 1, 2, 3 in that order, separated by other digits.
We count/generate numbers with this property.

=== Verification: small examples ===
  123: yes (expected yes)
  14253: yes (expected yes)
  321: no (expected no)
  132: no (expected no)

=== Count up to 1000 ===
  Numbers with 123-separated property in [1,1000]: 1

=== Sum up to 10000 ===
  Sum of 123-separated numbers in [1,10000]: 78530

=== PE Answer ===
  Answer = 9219661511328178
